          "text": " Eby'emibonano n'ebya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, kwonka ebishuurwirwe n'ebyaitu n'oruzaaro rwaitu ebiro byona, ngu tubone kworobera ebigambo byona eby'ebiragiro ebi.",
